      "id": "claim_cf0d9bae164b42bdb287b9b71647ead6",
      "statement": "SANDMAN's default Compose stack runs six SANDMAN-implemented services — orchestrator, extraction-agent and query-service (Python/FastAPI), tlr-agent and inconsistency-agent (Java 21 on Quarkus), and llm-replay — plus four infrastructure containers: Memgraph (Bolt 7687), NATS JetStream (4222, monitor 8222), the Bifrost llm-gateway (8080, admin UI published on 127.0.0.1:8081) and the Caddy edge-proxy (publishing 8080/8090/3001 on 127.0.0.1).",
