      "statement": "The orchestrator stores the A2A messageId in SQLite before SendMessage and completes a step only when its completion event (causationid = messageId) arrives; GetTask polling (30 s initial, growing to 2 min) exists only to detect FAILED/REJECTED/CANCELED/lost-task/timeout conditions, with per-skill timeouts (extract 15 min, TLR 60 min, detect 30 min) triggering CancelTask and a retry.",
