      "statement": "Domain events use a single JetStream stream SANDMAN capturing sandman.> with file storage, 90-day retention, a 2-minute duplicate window and Nats-Msg-Id = event id; the CloudEvents subject carries the projectId plus correlationid/causationid/traceparent extensions, and the catalog is exactly five event types (ingestion.completed, extraction.completed, tracelinks.updated, inconsistencies.updated, inconsistency.status.changed).",
