    {
      "id": "claim_22748eb2564d4af69b0f61624d45d40e",
      "statement": "Agent skills publish exactly one completion event per task with causationid equal to the A2A messageId; the producer ordering is commit KG writes, validate output, publish and await the JetStream ack (3 retries with backoff), then report COMPLETED, so a publish failure after the KG commit fails the task as retryable and the retried task republishes safely thanks to deterministic ids and MERGE.",
      "evidence": [
