      "id": "claim_917d364129d641d4b4aa42a598f0d5e3",
      "statement": "The query-service is the only user entry point and the policy decision point (ADR-0013): it authenticates users, checks per-project roles, and forwards owner operations (ingestion to extraction-agent, triage to inconsistency-agent, workflows to orchestrator) with its own service token plus X-Sandman-Actor/X-Sandman-Roles headers built from the authenticated principal; owners accept these headers only from the query-service token, and the orchestrator is the only trusted forwarder of sandman.actor in A2A metadata.",
      "evidence": [
