      "id": "claim_2d9685abfcc44a1d9d394f3b0bccdaf1",
      "statement": "Every LLM call goes through llm-replay (http://llm-replay:8000/openai) to the Bifrost gateway; because the internal network has no egress and only the gateway sits on egress, gateway-only access is enforced by the network itself, each LLM-using component holds a cloud key and an Ollama-only local key, gateway budget exhaustion (HTTP 402) becomes SkillError BUDGET_EXCEEDED and ends the step BLOCKED without retrying, and local-only projects are enforced by the gateway rejecting cloud routes for the -local key (HTTP 403 provider_blocked).",
