    {
      "id": "claim_26ae3a52c19d45f2b0e7a4dd1fafa838",
      "statement": "The orchestrator (ADR-0006) is a deterministic rule engine: every event is processed exactly once via an inbox keyed by event id, steps are deduplicated by actionKey = sha256(agent, skill, canonical input, trigger id), mergeable steps are debounced (10 s) and coalesced, the executor enforces a per-project pipeline lock plus a per-agent limit (default 2), all state lives in SQLite, and workflow status is derived from step statuses; an optional LLM planner is planned for M6 only.",
      "evidence": [
