      "id": "claim_c6def7d28c7c4631894f8e93b69ab135",
      "statement": "Events that exceed max_deliver (5) or fail contract validation are recorded in the orchestrator's dead_events table and can be reprocessed via POST /v1/dead-events/{eventId}/replay, which moves the event back into the inbox; durable pull consumers ack on success and nak with backoff (5 s, 30 s, 120 s, 300 s) on handler exceptions.",
