      "id": "claim_c5324b36f4274465842ba71d656e54c1",
      "statement": "Plugins are external systems (ADR-0012), never SANDMAN agents: extraction plugins implement the A2A plugin skill sandman.plugin.extract, detector plugins plain HTTP POST /v1/detect with identical payload schemas; plugins never write the KG, detector plugins read the graph only through the query-service with their own plugin:<id> token (granted per project in config/query/plugins.yaml), owners call plugins with the plugin's inbound token, and in M0 each owner implements exactly one transport (extraction via A2A, detection via HTTP, decision D-7).",
